RPent (Apache License 2.0; The RLinf Authors)
  https://github.com/RLinf/RPent
  - The rpent namespace and retained robots/ integration modules derive from
    RPent. RoboHarness-Zero extends that framework with planning, policy
    coordination, verification, recovery and evaluation support.
  - This distribution is a curated RoboCasa/Xiaomi subset of the historical
    Harness 2.0 source, originally internal version 1.2.3.5 at commit
    c8911c64f24393e8665bd9ecc34f819173d9c3ba. SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json and
